  "ms_tx": {
    "kf78f9bbe06964a45_html": ") came through empty, so a basic layout is shown. Shopify may have refused one of its sections on upload: check the upload warnings under Online Store → Themes.",
    "kfe38bb129e795830_html": "02 · Inside a Midsummer bed",
    "kd64c1ee4f641a79b_html": "04 · Why Midsummer",
    "kdeb070cc230e1521_html": "100 cm",
    "k49969b1561a3e601_html": "100 × 100, 180 × 80 and 80 × 50 cm; other sizes on request",
    "ke29d6493a4f2457d_html": "100 × 200 × 10 cm",
    "k45009bd5fc941e62_html": "100% cotton",
    "k3103a12232d80604_html": "100% linen",
    "k5cf3a317e2e2dc30_html": "101 cm",
    "k39e5a18bd869166b_html": "103 cm",
    "k39c705f024d048cc_html": "105 cm",
    "ka36977ab3f063a54_html": "107 cm",
    "ked2bca291182baf0_html": "130 cm",
    "kc5727c2cd7cb2651_html": "137 cm",
    "k9b1c122f4937fd90_html": "153 × 203 × 10 cm",
    "kd1e30e964d4e5155_html": "154 cm",
    "ka5da04064e3d06f1_html": "160 × 200 cm",
    "k0f1986b9b4c0d7c8_html": "160 × 200 × 10 cm",
    "k839e352cf1078843_html": "170–180 × 200 cm",
    "kb8af8f1bce2190a7_html": "180 × 200 × 10 cm",
    "k2dedd70bca938d22_html": "193 × 203 × 10 cm",
    "k3446fa860c2772f1_html": "200 × 200 × 10 cm",
    "k9eceb6a8b9d0117e_html": "3 cm, medium to firm",
    "k906e84ad8a5fcd96_html": "5 cm, soft",
    "ka9696502fbbbb00a_html": "60% linen, 40% cashmere",
    "k4f5a2b9b289d41e0_html": "64% linen, 36% cotton",
    "k730934044c31e297_html": "90% virgin wool, 10% cashmere",
    "k8cc872b77afd5eb2_html": "9–10 cm, soft",
    "kb5f51aea1d611875_html": "<p>15 + 15: at fifteen years the mattress returns to the artisans who made it and is regenerated for fifteen more.</p>",
    "k590d3c18df13f5f1_html": "<p><strong>High</strong> 9–10 cm, soft</p><p><strong>Medium</strong> 5 cm, soft</p>",
    "kbdab0bc384b38627_html": "<p><strong>Single</strong> 100 × 200 × 10 cm</p><p><strong>Queen</strong> 153 × 203 × 10 cm</p><p><strong>Small Double</strong> 160 × 200 × 10 cm</p><p><strong>Double</strong> 180 × 200 × 10 cm</p><p><strong>King</strong> 193 × 203 × 10 cm</p><p><strong>Double Extra</strong> 200 × 200 × 10 cm</p>",
    "k44009b0c14ce5cc2_html": "<p><strong>Thin</strong> 3 cm, medium to firm</p>",
    "k146cdd16a31dff00_html": "<p>A bed lives in the intimacy of your home. In <strong>“The Art of Rest”</strong> we place our designer beds inside re-imagined masterpieces, linking bedroom art to daily wellbeing. Each downloadable image shows how comfort, beauty, and storytelling unite in a single piece of sustainable craftsmanship.</p><p><em>Free high-resolution downloads: use them as mood-board inspiration, wallpapers, or a gentle reminder that rest itself can be a work of art.</em></p>",
    "kb93187407e3086a3_html": "<p>A core built by hand follows the body instead of pushing back against it, at every point and in every position you sleep in.</p>",
    "k3d4f210148df25b3_html": "<p>A fox naps amid ornate flora, proving luxury can speak nature’s language.</p>",
    "k886c27bd0d730399_html": "<p>A surreal landscape where even the wild find peace — showing how natural materials bring elemental comfort.</p>",
    "kd8318da4d696c570_html": "<p>Amid roses and symbolism, our bed becomes part of Kahlo’s inner world — a sanctuary for identity, beauty, and restorative sleep.</p>",
    "k95b51d3c397f9071_html": "<p>Any dimension, height or radius, round beds included, made to your drawing. Size, firmness, fibres and cloth are chosen with you.</p>",
    "k54a389648923a19d_html": "<p>Architectural stillness meets soft elegance; the bed serves as a pedestal for focused calm.</p>",
    "k983d00e2d4cf0246_html": "<p>At our showrooms, agents and resellers in Italy, San Marino, the United Kingdom, Poland, Russia, Canada, the United States and Hong Kong. The map on Agents &amp; Resellers shows each of them.</p>",
    "k3cd82dede6991282_html": "<p>At the atelier in Milan, by appointment, or at our agents and resellers in Europe, the Americas and Asia.</p>",
    "kb21804cc28961bc6_html": "<p>Baby alpaca, camel hair, Cheviot and Falkland wool, horsehair, vegetable horsehair, yak hair, mohair, cashmere, silk, linen, organic cotton, Ingeo and Orange Fiber. Vicuña is used in the Icons collection. Systems are upholstered in Loro Piana Interiors fabrics.</p>",
    "ka6d1c5799c273e0c_html": "<p>Baby alpaca, camel hair, Cheviot and Falkland wool, horsehair, vegetable horsehair, yak hair, mohair, cashmere, silk, linen, organic cotton, Ingeo and Orange Fiber; vicuña in the Icons collection.</p>",
    "k1c13c2ef8f676c09_html": "<p>Because every system is made to order, and the price follows the specification: dimensions, height, fibres, fabric and comfort level. We quote after the consultation. Price on request.</p>",
    "ka1ceb828582b6c0e_html": "<p>Because every system is made to order, and the price follows the specification: dimensions, height, fibres, fabric and comfort level. We quote after the consultation.</p>",
    "k313afa71dd35b8f4_html": "<p>Because nothing is made before it is specified. Size, firmness, fibres and cloth are chosen with you, at the atelier or by video, and the system is quoted from that specification.</p>",
    "k5b1279dcc6c553c5_html": "<p>Blooming greens, soft light, and effortless romance surround a bed built for generations.</p>",
    "kfb0913328da22138_html": "<p>Book an appointment at the atelier in Milan or by video, or write to us from the enquiry page. The system is specified with you (size, height, firmness, fibres and cloth) and you receive a written proposal. The bed is made to order once the proposal is confirmed.</p>",
    "k5a86aee67e8f9a7e_html": "<p>By hand in Italy, one by one, start to finish. Nothing is made before it is specified.</p>",
    "k5a34754536c3d6b6_html": "<p>By hand in Italy. Every sleep system is built by hand, one by one, from the first stitch to the final seam.</p>",
    "kdb447ff5d82b3de2_html": "<p>By our own team, in phases aligned to your floor handovers: each bed is brought into the room, assembled and dressed.</p>",
    "k3607e7dd2a16952c_html": "<p>Choose a morning or an afternoon, at the atelier or by video. A person replies within one working day.</p>",
    "kb10f20f7a6989c99_html": "<p>Come and lie down on Paisley at the atelier, by appointment, Monday to Friday.</p>",
    "k69c87564f73ef8ca_html": "<p>Download the entire bedroom art series and learn how our luxury Italian beds are handcrafted for longevity, sustainability, and heirloom value.</p>",
    "k18094ef180ea67e1_html": "<p>Drawings, sections and material schedules for your set, fabric references from Loro Piana Interiors and samples of the natural fibres.</p>",
    "k890d4e25b5eb9d99_html": "<p>Dreams feel weightless yet meaningful — mirroring the balanced support of natural fibre mattresses.</p>",
    "ka208bf9a0f7e2e0f_html": "<p>Each system comes with its housekeeping protocol, and we offer on-site rotation and care training for your team.</p>",
    "k5edb48c2ac0d9b98_html": "<p>Essentials is the entry point — five systems, natural fibres, authentic artisan construction. Signature is the heart of the collection — seven systems in precious natural fibres, in natural linen or Loro Piana Interiors, built for the highest comfort. Icons is the most important work we do — twelve systems, vicuña and cashmere, fully upholstered.</p>",
    "keb78ecd2d48cf09d_html": "<p>Essentials, Signature and Icons, made up as they would be at home. Take your time on each.</p>",
    "k2349c93f0e3a655c_html": "<p>Essentials, Signature and Icons. The same hands make all three; they differ in the cloth, the rarity of the fibres and how far the bespoke goes.</p>",
    "ka529e88ef5ab034d_html": "<p>Every cloth here is on one of our systems, with the colours we make it in. Choose a colour to see it larger, and ask for it: the atelier on Via Andegari holds the cards, and sends samples by post.</p>",
    "k38f008320bc49bf3_html": "<p>Every piece is built by hand in Italy, from start to finish: two or three full days of work for each mattress. It is not a marketing promise; it is a method.</p><p>Because the bed is made by hand at every stage, nothing goes inside it that its makers did not choose and place themselves. And because they know it from the inside, the bed can come back to them at fifteen years to be opened, renewed and made ready for fifteen more.</p>",
    "kda2a81abe0fe8dc4_html": "<p>Fire-retardancy and contract certification are prepared for each market and documented for your file.</p>",
    "kdb1e8f8bfe8033b2_html": "<p>Green Product Award 2025 for the Top system (<a href=\"https://www.gp-award.com/en/produkte/top-bed-system\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the award</a>). Featured by Il Sole 24 Ore, Kommersant, Elle Decor and Architectural Digest; at the Salone del Mobile, Milan.</p>",
    "ka2a4e5d6032154bd_html": "<p>How a Midsummer bed comes together, stage by stage. Nothing is glued; everything can be reached again.</p>",
    "k5a4f011ca367e46d_html": "<p>In Milan, in 2014, by an architect who wanted the bed designed with the same care as every other piece of a room.</p>",
    "kbf80c744b5544944_html": "<p>It depends on how you sleep and how far you want the bespoke to go. Essentials is natural comfort, done properly; Signature adds precious fibres, and Loro Piana Interiors on Dreamy and Brera; Icons is the house without limits. The five questions of Find your Midsummer suggest a system, and at the atelier in Milan you can lie on all three.</p>",
    "ke765cf32b52760f1_html": "<p>It depends on how you sleep. On your side, hips and shoulders need to sink a little; on your back, the lumbar curve needs support; on your front, a flatter, firmer surface keeps the neck neutral. The five questions of Find your Midsummer suggest a system, and at the atelier you choose by lying down.</p>",
    "k0a0e9c2ccb7263e6_html": "<p>It is made to last and to be renewed: at fifteen years it goes back to our artisans in Italy, who renew it by hand for fifteen more.</p>",
    "k69429faef29fa4b0_html": "<p>Italian, English and Russian.</p>",
    "k2ef47a6b53300662_html": "<p>Last, the upholstery: Loro Piana Interiors fabrics, chosen for your room. Two or three days after it was begun, the bed is finished by hand, as it was begun.</p>",
    "k145789044692b854_html": "<p>Loro Piana Interiors, chosen from the fabric book against the bed itself.</p>",
    "k4cf9c4d4ff49ff9a_html": "<p>Mattresses, mattress toppers, boxsprings and beds with headboards; duvets, pillows, blankets and throws.</p>",
    "k141ef035d62b76fc_html": "<p>Midsummer Milano began with a question its founder, an architect, kept asking: why is the bed treated as a technical product from a catalogue, when every other piece of a room is chosen with care?</p><p>Sleep Culture is where we follow that question: how material, temperature, proportion and ritual shape the night, and what making beds by hand, and listening to the people who sleep in them, has taught us.</p>",
    "k0f749dcbbfe4af55_html": "<p>Midsummer Milano is a luxury bed and mattress house from Milan. Every piece is made to order, by hand in Italy, from natural fibres.</p>",
    "k94cef563aeca3545_html": "<p>Midsummer Milano was founded in Milan by Chiara Mennini, an architect, around a question she kept asking: why is the bed, where we spend a third of our lives, treated as a technical product from a catalogue, when every other piece of a room is designed with care?</p>",
    "k069ff203c6661803_html": "<p>Midsummer beds can also be seen at showrooms, agents and resellers in Europe, the Americas and Asia. See Agents &amp; Resellers for the map.</p>",
    "k49e23b8f88811972_html": "<p>Monday to Friday, by appointment. Or by video, wherever you are.</p>",
    "k9810f60930817d48_html": "<p>Mystic River, Connemara, Altai, Wish, Cardi, Ely’s Harbour, Bangor and Shadan: each chosen for the system it dresses, each in its own colours. The others are covered in natural linen and cotton.</p>",
    "k5b09bb31e5ad9c82_html": "<p>Natural fibres breathe. Wool and horsehair carry warmth and moisture away from the body, so the bed stays even through the night, in August as in January.</p>",
    "k34f2ccda6468762d_html": "<p>No. Every system, in every collection, is made by hand in Italy, from natural fibres. The collections differ in the cloth, the rarity of the fibres and how far each system is made to measure.</p>",
    "k04d2029e819928fc_html": "<p>No. Natural fibres breathe: wool and horsehair carry warmth and moisture away from the body, so the bed stays even through the night, in August as in January.</p>",
    "k09ff10f37e3e6303_html": "<p>On request. Each system is quoted from its specification, after a consultation at the atelier or by video.</p>",
    "kdafa39a5ae03e4c8_html": "<p>One person at the atelier, from the first specification to delivery and installation.</p>",
    "k953e064d7bbd121b_html": "<p>Our regeneration service. At year fifteen the mattress returns to the Italian artisans who made it, and its comfort, integrity and life are restored for the fifteen years ahead, rather than the system being replaced.</p>",
    "k5821c2b2e93feb86_html": "<p>Private homes, architects and interior designers, hotels, villas and yachts.</p>",
    "k1af6e8ddeab994d3_html": "<p>Production and delivery windows are confirmed on enquiry, because each system is made to order. Delivery is white-glove: the bed is brought into the room, assembled and dressed by our own team.</p>",
    "k0500f0b9600172e5_html": "<p>Rest has a rhythm. Our toppers turn with the year: linen and silk to face the summer, wool and cashmere for the winter, in the same bed.</p>",
    "kca7f0d9291805c58_html": "<p>Rotate head to foot every three months for the first year, then twice yearly. Air the system when you change the linen. Loro Piana Interiors upholstery is removable: clean it as its care label directs, and ask the atelier whenever in doubt.</p>",
    "kee3ec341b5e3f041_html": "<p>Several of the fibres we use are naturally hypoallergenic: alpaca, for example, contains no lanolin. If you have a specific allergy, tell us at the consultation and the specification is adapted.</p>",
