    "kac824ac6fca61c38_html": "<span style=\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.06em;\">Green Product Award</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(251, 249, 245, 0.62);\">Berlin, 2025</span>",
    "kce39e5dce9074fef_html": "A Bactrian camel crossing the snow.",
    "kb3d3ad43d05e97f7_html": "A Midsummer bed",
    "k9ba2ad2fa2e6de18_html": "A Midsummer bed against a frescoed wall, with a paisley throw",
    "k7df29be966e17dbf_html": "A Midsummer bed beneath tall wrought-iron arched windows",
    "k992026c8b9f29612_html": "A Midsummer bed by a whitewashed wall, under bougainvillea",
    "k912b6a064ed06817_html": "A Midsummer bed in a frescoed loft, beneath a spiral stair",
    "k0d03bb69007fa130_html": "A Midsummer bed in a glass house among the trees",
    "k9573a285e60582ee_html": "A Midsummer bed is not assembled. It is made, by hand, from the first gesture to the last stitch.",
    "k2837ebb9b441de4e_html": "A Midsummer bed on a sand dune, under a summer sky",
    "ke083cf8bb7c857cc_html": "A Midsummer bed with an upholstered headboard, against a patterned wall",
    "k74f3b78d753d232b_html": "A Midsummer boxspring in Mystic River fabric to match.",
    "k98fe659dfa0f1c36_html": "A Midsummer boxspring: the foundation of the bed, and the part of it the room sees.",
    "kf6b1ee01c80be9e6_html": "A Midsummer mattress",
    "k23b96fbf3a73dc6e_html": "A Midsummer system is made to last thirty years. A few habits keep it as it was made.",
    "k9c232545c561b5e0_html": "A balanced surface that works in every position.",
    "kb480247071f2e3ff_html": "A bas-relief of flowers and their leaves, worked by hand.",
    "k033c4550f7a18353_html": "A base alone: a side table",
    "kca5f2e4ab088b875_html": "A bed in plan and elevation, with its dimensions",
    "k593c8c2c73e55c1b_html": "A bed is more than furniture; it is a cultural object.",
    "k741a807b0dfa3a31_html": "A bed that lasts thirty years is not a green claim, it is arithmetic. Everything below is a description of how these beds are made, not a policy.",
    "kcc4e711b953923a4_html": "A bed your guests remember.",
    "kffa3de1dc483d1e4_html": "A bouclé of wool and cashmere, soft and deep, its loops catching the light. It dresses Bellini, and the boxspring of Flora.",
    "kcc8e294448a141da_html": "A boxspring with four mahogany drawers beneath.",
    "kd06017bb1c87f017_html": "A catalogue of standard sizes.",
    "kfd860de40792f3fe_html": "A consultation at the atelier on Via Andegari, or by video, after which dimensions, heights, fibres, fabric and comfort level are specified and the system is built by hand.",
    "k79414b16feab8bee_html": "A conversation",
    "k0fd18c62acb7f87f_html": "A curved headboard of Canaletto walnut enclosing a panel of Vienna straw; the beveled frame is walnut too, in a natural matt finish.",
    "kd56edaaaccc073f4_html": "A fine down with shallow, smooth scales and a soft, irregular wave: the wave keeps the fibres apart, and that is where the air is held.",
    "k7758fe1085e9a84e_html": "A fine pure linen for the surface you sleep on in summer.",
    "k5f1e47f5f86aeb90_html": "A fine, very warm and particularly robust hair, soft and fluffy, with the look of cashmere. The yak is neither shorn nor combed: in May its winter undercoat falls, and the nomads gather it.",
    "k203de51c04dd2e33_html": "A flat ribbon that twists on itself: the twists let the fibres hold one another in a soft, even yarn, and the fibre takes up moisture readily.",
    "k65044c8c1f46637a_html": "A flatter, firmer surface keeps the neck neutral.",
    "k16edb7b36d8efc87_html": "A guest remembers the bed. It is the one piece of furniture they spend eight hours inside.",
    "k7c222c136da47b1c_html": "A headboard of padded folds, parted by a band of pure silk.",
    "kf815bda6a09e0b28_html": "A headboard on request, in Connemara linen with natural leather straps.",
    "kdf7c1146f944260f_html": "A herd of goats coming down a mountain valley.",
    "kc03b7cf1d2c37ab8_html": "A house of beds from Milan, made by hand in Italy.",
    "k8acf967f9afbb12f_html": "A house of beds in Milan",
    "kd87568d7afb57a49_html": "A lightweight yet highly warm fibre, naturally hypoallergenic since it contains no lanolin. Its hollow structure retains warmth without trapping moisture — durable, soft, and breathable.",
    "k914e79a77bbded0b_html": "A linen and cotton with a soft, nubbed hand, heavy enough to hold the line of a mattress. The cloth we use most, in twelve colours.",
    "k9a3f587af0d6a887_html": "A linen woven with a paisley, from the Paisley book. On Paisley it covers the topper, with Katai, a pure silk (AS1005), on the boxspring.",
    "k774134f715b55ca3_html": "A mattress that comes home.",
    "kded3eb0fe5c45ede_html": "A mattress that does not need to be rebuilt is the most sustainable mattress of all.",
    "k8939aae81f4a797c_html": "A person replies, within one working day.",
    "k5e80515490931f3d_html": "A plain, precious headboard that can carry a discreet embroidery: simple to look at, and a work that reveals itself over years of living with it.",
    "k6f4ce3de5b46743e_html": "A production line, with many hands and no one answerable for the whole.",
    "kd0560f2fb26d2214_html": "A project, step by step",
    "ke22765447edafd38_html": "A pure linen with a clear, even weave, cool to the touch and quick to breathe.",
    "ke3333a0c9d12a982_html": "A reply from a person",
    "k61e92fe8120f6da4_html": "A round bed for a Tuscan abbey.",
    "kfe43193b7f5430a6_html": "A round bed in Canaletto walnut, beautiful from every side.",
    "k4828e367c073ddd9_html": "A sculptural headboard whose wings fold on hidden brass hinges.",
    "kc6af3288f9bc8f87_html": "A slender base that holds two or four upholstered drawers.",
    "kffb9bc5e6793faaf_html": "A slim Midsummer boxspring: the foundation of the bed, and the part of it the room sees.",
    "k03bbb93588a35122_html": "A sofa gets specified. A kitchen gets designed. The bed, where we spend a third of our lives, deserves the same care.",
    "kfab05ddd86762f77_html": "A soft boxspring, padded with wool felt.",
    "k11a3db5b5ac89816_html": "A specification, then the making",
    "kee5a6345dd2dbff5_html": "A square, thought of as one large bed, that comes apart into as many compositions as there are guests and occasions: from the deck of a yacht to a villa by the sea, to a veranda in the country. Choose one, or let the pieces choose.",
    "k99f3c356e1187c51_html": "A summer face in linen and silk, a winter face in wool and cashmere: turned when the year turns, never replaced.\nFrom a fine topper over an existing bed to the full topper of a system, and Roma, with its own headboard.",
    "k7186fd209bda553e_html": "A sustainable fibre derived from maize. With wool, linen and cotton, it is on the summer side: fresh and breathable.",
    "k04725438f3f4ec1d_html": "A vicuña topper on request: vicuña, silk and wool.",
    "k416d54c54acaa91a_html": "A warm welcome and an even temperature, in a few centimetres of precious fibres.\nMedium to firm.",
    "k2b43ded8c96e805c_html": "A warm welcome and an even temperature, in a few centimetres of precious fibres. Medium to firm.",
    "k49066c51b32c96d8_html": "A white horse beside a Midsummer bed in a meadow",
    "k5e3e6ff7148496c4_html": "A winter side and a summer side, turned with the season.",
    "k7e8ad315332b444e_html": "A winter topper in Cheviot wool and cashmere, on request.",
    "k90f5d32304c21ef2_html": "A woman resting on a Midsummer mattress",
    "kdc076a9f4f35066e_html": "A wraparound headboard, padded and quilted with leaves that interweave and make way, sprout and grow, repair and protect.",
    "kad16548028d2f188_html": "A wraparound headboard, quilted with leaves large and small.",
    "k93bc2a645b763190_html": "A written specification and its price, for your system, size and room.",
    "kd20d08502bba7de4_html": "A yak on a misty mountainside.",
