    "k78848b5ef5b3ff67_html": "At a glance",
    "k2db71696e1ddfe76_html": "At fifteen years your mattress comes back to the artisans who made it. They open it, wash and re-card the fibres, renew what the years have worn and close it again, for fifteen more.",
    "kb83d29a68a525061_html": "At fifteen years, the artisans who made it take it back for fifteen more.",
    "k28ca0f5e81101be0_html": "At most, combed from one young camel in a year.",
    "kcc2b710db8207411_html": "At our Milan atelier, or by video call",
    "k29a288add58ed2bf_html": "At the atelier on Via Andegari, by video, or at your project: the room, the way you sleep, the cloth.",
    "kf982cb61edde2f25_html": "At the atelier on Via Andegari, or by video. We ask how you sleep before we show you anything.",
    "k5373a571df4792ae_html": "At the atelier or by video",
    "k4f2924694782bbce_html": "At the atelier or by video call",
    "kdd2bb7b592a0a840_html": "At the source",
    "kcb31f19a162dd37c_html": "At year fifteen the mattress returns to the artisans who made it and its comfort, integrity and life are restored for the fifteen years ahead. The alternative — replacement — is the thing this service exists to avoid.",
    "k37e665c72d356b0e_html": "At year fifteen the mattress returns to the artisans who made it.",
