    "kde0208e7a19be111_html": "Each bed is made to order: for a suite, a villa or a cabin, width, length and height are set to the plan, and the cloth to the room.",
    "k2ac9f43a39de0fc0_html": "Each dot is a quality of the fibres inside that system, as described on Natural materials. Size, firmness and cloth are chosen with you.",
    "k4c9b4fbb2b548a0b_html": "Each system drawn to its room, with the Loro Piana Interiors cloths and the fibres sent to you by post.",
    "k416a77b979136cdf_html": "Each system is built by hand, start to finish, in Italy. No production line and no minimum run. A bed is made when it is ordered, which is why there is nothing to discount and nothing to clear.",
    "kfc6a4c46dd87c721_html": "Each system is specified with you, at the atelier or by video: dimensions, firmness, fibres and cloth. Prices on request.",
