    "k8a5f0593634b5d1c_html": "Every Midsummer bed is made by hand in Italy, from natural fibres. What changes from one collection to the next is the cloth, the rarity of the fibres and how far the bespoke goes.",
    "k468d878c53d6d9a2_html": "Every Midsummer system is made to order, which means dimensions, heights, fabrics and comfort levels are specification decisions rather than exceptions. Send us the plan and the fabric direction; we return a technical proposal, a sample set and a delivery window.",
    "k7a3a150b07d7fa94_html": "Every Midsummer system is made to order. Width, length and height, a radius or a split, are set with you and drawn before anything is made.",
    "kacf2e553b1f56ba0_html": "Every bed in the programme made by hand in Italy.",
