    "k5d9ae29da0ff50fe_html": "Every note is written at the atelier on Via Andegari, where the beds can be lain on and the fibres held. Visit by appointment, or meet us by video.",
    "k15b009847307b060_html": "Every one made to order.",
    "k2453545bf73c1148_html": "Every part can be reached. Fibres can be opened, redistributed and replaced; upholstery can be taken off and remade. A system is a set of serviceable parts, not a sealed unit.",
    "k2a16fc6ca2d43f9c_html": "Every system in this collection is shown at the atelier and made to order. Ask us for the full list, with photographs.",
    "ke6a36f009d126947_html": "Every system is a topper, a mattress and a boxspring, made together by hand in Italy and specified with you: size, firmness, fibres and cloth.",
    "k5cc3c7116a5708dc_html": "Every system is made to order. The fibres are where it starts; the comfort is set with you, at the atelier or by video.",
    "ke526495d3cbade0b_html": "Every tuft tied by hand, every border stitched by hand.",
    "kd8f127f702720ea9_html": "Every year, we ask ourselves the same question: what can we make better?",
