    "kfcfe02d3c33d6fb6_html": "It is edged with a ribbon in caramel or pink. Another cloth on request, chosen with you at the atelier.",
    "kf3ba72e0aacbb2cd_html": "It shields the camel from the extremes of the desert, cold and heat, and does the same in a bed. Fine and soft, it holds a great deal of air, and it is more hygroscopic than sheep’s wool: a dry, pleasant warmth.",
