    "keb082df47a404db0_html": "Midsummer Milano in Style Interiors, the Russian design magazine.",
    "k594cf1282c888f5e_html": "Midsummer Milano is born from the meeting of Italian design, exceptional craftsmanship and the finest natural materials. Every sleep system is built by hand, one by one, start to finish. This artisanal continuity makes true customisation possible: in dimensions, heights, materials, fabrics, and comfort levels. Not an exception, but our standard.",
    "k09598dd97b1f2013_html": "Midsummer Milano × Sustainability",
    "kf7e98733a7d50a9a_html": "Midsummer Milano — the atelier",
    "k223fe6eacae2c060_html": "Midsummer Treasures",
    "kf482833196dc6682_html": "Midsummer supplies hotels, branded residences and yachts with the same hand-built natural-fibre systems we make for private clients — specified for contract life and delivered in phases, room by room.",
