    "kc8972b08c477f355_html": "Most industrial mattresses are replaced every eight to ten years. A Midsummer mattress goes back to the artisans who made it at fifteen, and comes home for fifteen more.",
    "k217e55c0b697f312_html": "Most industrial mattresses end up in landfill after eight or ten years. In Europe alone, more than thirty million mattresses become waste each year. A Midsummer mattress is built differently. By hand, in Italy, with wool from small Italian farms, horsehair and noble natural fibres.",
    "k18d769de61a10fe6_html": "Most luxury beds are sold on a name. Ours are sold on what is inside them, who makes them, and what happens to them fifteen years later.",
    "k7d237dfbb1986208_html": "Mountain, northern, or a house kept cool.",
