    "kcdda55c3aa382ef8_html": "One large bed, 180 by 180.\nA sofa for the long lunch, and an ottoman for whoever arrives late.\nA lounger to the sun, a table for the glass, and a seat for the conversation.\nTwo siestas, at a polite distance.\nA daybed and a corner, side by side.\nComposition number six. Or sixty.\nThe cat's arrangement.\nAfter the guests had gone.\nSiesta for one, aperitivo for six.\nMany (many many, really) more.",
    "k69315f9900d8b8e1_html": "One mattress, thirty years.",
    "kf5f12b9e7907a6fe_html": "One of the most attractive things about the flowers is their beautiful reserve.",
    "k22355913ff8dc297_html": "One side, all year.",
