    "k498ff1e910b56c82_html": "Our commitment to genuine sustainability in luxury mattress making has been recognised internationally.",
    "k5030b9fa63a5beab_html": "Our cotton is a fresh, breathable, and natural material ideal for summer. It enhances the mattress’ ability to regulate temperature, keeping you cool and comfortable throughout the warmer months.",
    "k284feb2ecc7a3b01_html": "Our mattresses and bed bases are crafted exclusively with natural materials selected for their quality, durability, and comfort. Read them by the benefit you are after.",
    "kc52086b0bf8ab916_html": "Our mattresses and bed bases are made only with natural materials, chosen for their quality, durability and comfort. They come from farms where animals are treated ethically: cashmere only from Mongolia, horsehair from Argentina, where horses live free, and wool from small farms. Read them by what matters most to you.",
    "kff86e6ba481aa402_html": "Our most compact system: one clean line from the floor to the topper.\nIts feel is chosen with you, from soft to firm.",
    "k8dd0164367885a4c_html": "Our most compact system: one clean line from the floor to the topper.\nIts feel is chosen with you, from soft to firm.\nUpholstered in Loro Piana Interiors Mystic River fabric, in any of its twelve colours, or two-tone with natural linen and cotton.\nSplit in two on request, for the wider sizes.",
    "k3b7d29d71bf75501_html": "Our most compact system: one clean line from the floor to the topper. Its feel is chosen with you, from soft to firm.",
    "k1a1e8a5c74fe703d_html": "Our most compact system: one clean line from the floor to the topper. Its feel is chosen with you, from soft to firm. Upholstered in Loro Piana Interiors Mystic River fabric, in any of its twelve colours, or two-tone with natural linen and cotton. Split in two on request, for the wider sizes.",
    "k0142ddd40c61f1fb_html": "Our newsletter, sent regularly: new notes, new systems, and the dates the atelier opens.",
