    "k4ae80052d2d5af47_html": "Slender boxspring, balcony proportions.",
    "k73f50ed8e51b10e1_html": "Slender metal legs",
    "kda2b18d6cd2def2b_html": "Slim and architectural, its front a bas-relief of flowers among their leaves, made by hand, slowly, for a quiet, modern elegance.",
    "kf1e2b7060564d61d_html": "Slow, by method.",
    "kd8f025b915a8803f_html": "Small Double",
    "k8d8d62e828be9ecc_html": "Smooth, regular scales and a soft wave: the wave holds the fibres a little apart, and the still air caught between them is what keeps you warm.",
    "k682160fc6ad12f78_html": "Soft",
    "kf5722d6284abe928_html": "Soft cushions curled around the headboard, on an inlay of Canaletto walnut.",
    "k22a8116bb730cddf_html": "Soft or medium, to warm the bed in the cold months.",
    "kf3cd7159b7b23dc4_html": "Softness",
    "k4a4659d192e8021c_html": "Softness first, with support underneath.",
    "kace6d403daa860c3_html": "Softness · Warmth",
    "k1eaed9c3755427d6_html": "Solid poplar, upholstered and embroidered ton-sur-ton; its wings fold on hidden brass hinges, to embrace the bed or open the room.",
    "k05740289f58fac57_html": "Some systems have two faces, in two cloths: wool and cashmere for winter, linen for summer. The bed is turned when the season changes, not replaced.",
    "k8fec8c4f81a2c6a5_html": "Sourced from the leaves of palm trees, mainly Chamaerops humilis. The leaves are dried, curled, and braided into tight ropes — a sustainable alternative to traditional horsehair with similar support and durability.",
    "ke8ce1ae5639bded0_html": "Sourced from the mountains of Peru, vicuña provides the most precious fibre in the world. Known as the \"fibre of the gods,\" it is silky, fluffy, and incredibly soft, offering unmatched luxury in our mattresses.",
    "k2cb5b88c56948094_html": "Southern Italy and Sicily",
