    "k0b8a50c853bdfd37_html": "The balanced build, most specified of all.",
    "k05faf1dd50c8d7b1_html": "The bedroom",
    "k080e9e91c027b31b_html": "The beds",
    "k65fc3122bd42db92_html": "The beds are made by hand in Italy, and can be lain on at the atelier in Milano. Elsewhere, a showroom, an agent or a reseller will receive you — by appointment, in a room, not a warehouse.",
    "k44538f86496de8db_html": "The blue-and-gold room, Via Andegari.",
    "kd42d38af9faf894b_html": "The body rests on the mattress, gently held by the softness of the fibres above it.\nWarm for the winter, cool and breathable for the summer.\nUpholstered in Loro Piana Interiors linen and cotton, or cashmere, in a range of colours.",
    "k8ee079c3cc74a35b_html": "The body rests on the mattress, gently held by the softness of the fibres above it. Warm for the winter, cool and breathable for the summer. Upholstered in Loro Piana Interiors linen and cotton, or cashmere, in a range of colours.",
